---
source: crates/repovec-core/src/appliance/systemd_units/tests.rs
expression: err.to_string()
---
repovec-provision.service must declare ExecStart=/usr/bin/systemd-sysusers /usr/lib/sysusers.d/repovec.conf, /usr/bin/systemd-tmpfiles --create /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/repovec.conf in order: /usr/bin/systemd-sysusers /usr/lib/sysusers.d/wrong.conf, /usr/bin/systemd-tmpfiles --create /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/repovec.conf
